      "content": "magnesium citrate?? i've heard that's a laxative, wouldn't that make the diarrhea worse? i'm looking at him now and his skin feels really dry and his eyes look sunken in. i'm getting really panicky. if i give him the magnesium and he's still not waking up, how long do i wait before i actually drive him to the hospital? i really don't want to take him to the ER if it's not necessary.",
